WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.256
The Watcher is a membership built around one new being every twenty eight days.

00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:12.508
In week one, enter the Realm.

00:00:12.508 --> 00:00:15.887
In week two, see the Process behind the vision.

00:00:15.887 --> 00:00:18.139
In week three, read the Records.

00:00:18.139 --> 00:00:21.142
In week four, return for the live Session.

00:00:21.142 --> 00:00:27.524
The monthly plan starts with seven days free, then costs twenty eight dollars every twenty eight days.

00:00:27.524 --> 00:00:32.029
An annual option is separate at two hundred eighty dollars a year.

00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:40.288
If you make a first payment and change your mind, contact support within seven nights of that payment for the stated return.

00:00:40.288 --> 00:00:42.540
Checkout and access stay with Whop.
